  "native_help_windows": [
    {
      "start_line_1based": 450,
      "lines": [
        "<p><b><a name=\"D5080\"></a>{D5080} Base Desired 1-&gt;2 Shift Time</b></p>",
        "<blockquote>",
        "<p>This is the base desired shift completion time (milliseconds) used for adaptive learning on a normal 1->2 shift.<br>",
        "This value is then further modified based on throttle position using table <a href=\"#D5100\">D5100 Desired 1->2 Shift Time Throttle Adjust</a>.<br>",
        "</p>",
        "</blockquote>",
        "<p><b><a name=\"D5081\"></a>{D5081} Base Desired 1-&gt;2 Shift Time, With TRQ Red</b></p>",
        "<blockquote>",
        "<p>This is the base desired shift completion time (milliseconds) used for adaptive learning on a normal 1->2 shift with Torque Reduction active.<br>",
        "This value is then further modified based on throttle position using table <a href=\"#D5101\">D5101 Desired 1->2 Shift Time Throttle Adjust, With TRQ Red</a>.<br>",
        "</p>",
        "</blockquote>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "start_line_1based": 547,
      "lines": [
        "<p><b><a name=\"D5100\"></a>{D5100} Desired 1-&gt;2 Shift Time Throttle Adjust</b></p>",
        "<blockquote>",
        "<p>Referencing the throttle position, this table will alter the final desired shift completion time defined by <a href=\"#D5080\">D5080 Base Desired 1->2 Shift Time</a> for a normal 1->2 shift.<br>",
        "<br>",
        "For example, assume the single 'Base' desired shift time is 500mS.<br>",
        "In this table you might see values ranging from 200ms to -200ms.<br>",
        "In these cases, the final desired shift time the adaptive learning aims for would become 700mS (500ms + 200ms) to 300mS (500mS - 200mS) as this table alters the single base value.<br>",
        "</p>",
        "</blockquote>",
        "<p><b><a name=\"D5101\"></a>{D5101} Desired 1-&gt;2 Shift Time Throttle Adjust, With TRQ Red</b></p>",
        "<blockquote>",
        "<p>Referencing the throttle position, this table will alter the final desired shift completion time defined by <a href=\"#D5081\">D5081 Base Desired 1->2 Shift Time, With TRQ Red</a> for a normal 1->2 shift with torque reduction active.<br>"
      ]
    }
  ],
